        "name": "Command",
        "score": 3,
        "rationale": "The log shows wt.exe \u2192 wsl.exe with --cd set to a WSL path for repos/example-api, the prompt as a single argument and the semicolon escaped, but claude is run bare via --exec with no env wrapper, so PATH= is missing (cap 4), the child-session marker is not cleared, persistence is not forced, and claude is not invoked by absolute path."
      },
      {
        "name": "Reply",
